<title>POLAND: Paged plans two-million-rights issue.</title>
<headline>Paged plans two-million-rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wood trader Paged SA plans to issue 2,019,050 rights, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Paged said the management's proposal would be voted on at a general shareholders meeting on June 26, but he did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
